# shir_nodes/read_line.node — ONE line from standard input.
#
# Normalises `read VAR` (docs/shir-reductions.md §Normalisation
# transforms): the value is the line WITHOUT its trailing newline; EOF
# yields the empty string. No IFS splitting (the subset's scripts read a
# single variable). Backends: JS runtime sh2.readLine, Perl scalar(<STDIN>)
# chomped, Java BufferedReader stdin, Zig stdin reader.

node ReadLine
tag "ReadLine"
kind expr
# storage_class str_bounded
